DreamWidgetEventBinding:SourceLine {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetPropertyBinding.h#DreamWidgetEventBinding:SourceLine
    src   "Where the `->` that produced this was written, 1-based, 0 when it came from anywhere else --\nthe same field FDreamWidgetPropertyBinding carries and for the same reason, spelled out\nthere. This is the half DUI6004 and DUI6005 read: the handler's existence and its signature\ncan only be judged once the class exists, which is after the AST is gone."
    text  "生成此处的 `->` 的书写位置，从 1 开始计数，来自其他位置时为 0——\n与 FDreamWidgetPropertyBinding 所携带的控件绑定字段相同，原因也相同，详见\n该处。这是 DUI6004 和 DUI6005 所读取的那一半：处理程序是否存在及其签名\n只能在类存在之后判断，而那时 AST 已经消失。"
    state machine
}

