DreamWidgetPropertyBinding:BehaviourIndex {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetPropertyBinding.h#DreamWidgetPropertyBinding:BehaviourIndex
    src   "Which behaviour, when Target is Behaviour: its index in the widget's component array.\n\nBy position, because a behaviour is an instanced sub-object and the authored copy and the\ninstanced one share no name -- the same correspondence the designer's own component editing\nruns on."
    text  "当 Target 为 Behaviour 时指定哪个行为：它在控件的组件数组中的索引。\n\n按位置指定，因为行为是实例化的子对象，创作副本与\n实例化副本不共享名称——设计器自身的组件编辑也建立在\n同样的对应关系上。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetPropertyBinding:Dependencies {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetPropertyBinding.h#DreamWidgetPropertyBinding:Dependencies
    src   "Every member path the source reads (FDreamUIProperty::BindingDependencies, recorded when the compiler lowered the\nexpression). With bDependenciesRecorded the run time watches these instead of looking FunctionName or NotifyField\nup as a field of the widget:\n - complete, and every hop announceable (DreamUIBindingPath::CanNotifyAlong from the widget's class): subscribed\n   through an FDreamUIBindingObserver, never polled;\n - otherwise: polled every frame, as every expression binding was before.\nEither way the binding is not evaluated while an object along any path is unset -- the target keeps the value it\nhad (the authored one, or the last one) rather than being reset by a chain that broke.\n\nNot recorded (an older compile, the designer's Bind button, a bare `F()`): the run time does what it always did."
    text  "源读取的每条成员路径（FDreamUIProperty::BindingDependencies，在编译器降级\n表达式时记录）。设置 bDependenciesRecorded 后，运行时会监视这些路径，而不是把 FunctionName 或 NotifyField\n当作控件的字段来查找：\n - 完整，且每一跳都可通告（DreamUIBindingPath::CanNotifyAlong，自控件的类起）：通过\n   FDreamUIBindingObserver 订阅，从不轮询；\n - 否则：每帧轮询，与此前所有表达式绑定一样。\n无论哪种方式，只要任一路径上的某个对象未设置，该绑定都不会求值——目标保留它\n原有的值（创作时设定的值，或最后一次的值），而不会被一条断掉的链重置。\n\n未记录（较早的编译、设计器的 Bind 按钮、裸写 `F()`）：运行时一如既往。"
    state machine
}

