EDreamWidgetBindingTarget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetPropertyBinding.h#EDreamWidgetBindingTarget
    src   "Which object on the widget a binding drives.\n\nA widget's interesting properties are mostly not on the widget: Text and FontSize belong to a\nUDreamText, which is the widget's VISUAL, and a behaviour has its own. The widget is only the\nthing that has a name, so the name alone does not say what to write to."
    text  "绑定驱动的是控件上的哪个对象。\n\n控件上值得关注的属性大多并不在控件本身：Text 和 FontSize（字体大小）属于\nUDreamText，也就是控件的可视对象，而行为也有自己的对象。控件只是那个\n拥有名称的东西，所以仅凭名称无法说明要写入哪个对象。"
    state machine
}

